+### Protein Ribbon Representation
+*   **Definition:** A ribbon representation for protein structures showing the backbone connectivity and secondary structure [S6, unofficial].
+*   **Step:** Show a strip representing the backbone spiraling around a cylinder for alpha helices. Show a strip with a directional arrow for strands in beta sheets. Show a narrower tube in other regions [S6, unofficial].
